<!DOCTYPE html>
<%# The layout for the page a care receiver's device leaves open all day.

    Its own layout, and not the dashboard's, for three reasons:

    1. In link mode there is no account. The dashboard nav offers Dashboard,
       Profile, Contact Us and Sign Out — every one of them a dead end for
       somebody who cannot sign in, on the screen least able to absorb a dead
       end.
    2. The dashboard pulls Tailwind from a CDN: roughly 400KB of JavaScript that
       compiles CSS in the browser, on a device chosen for sitting in a kitchen
       rather than for being fast. This page is the whole product for the person
       using it and it should not wait on a third party to become legible.
    3. No third-party request at all means nothing to leak to. The token is out
       of the address bar before this renders, so the referrer risk is already
       handled, but a page with no outbound requests cannot acquire a new one by
       somebody adding a font later.

    Everything sizes in rem so the font-size below scales the whole interface —
    that is the text-size setting, and it matters more here than anywhere else
    in the app. See User::TEXT_SCALES.

    The CSS is a deliberately small subset of the utility names the view and
    public/voice_reminders.js already use, written out rather than generated, so
    that the markup did not have to be rewritten to drop the CDN. Add a class
    here when the page needs one; there is no build step to run.
%>
<html style="font-size: <%= current_user&.text_scale || 100 %>%">
  <head>
    <title>My Reminders</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <%# A reminder link is a credential. Nothing here belongs in an index. %>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: #f9fafb;
        color: #111827;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      /* Layout */
      .max-w-7xl { max-width: 80rem; }
      .mx-auto { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
      .flex { display: flex; }
      .inline-flex { display: inline-flex; }
      .inline-block { display: inline-block; }
      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }
      .items-center { align-items: center; }
      .items-start { align-items: flex-start; }
      .justify-between { justify-content: space-between; }
      .justify-center { justify-content: center; }
      .gap-4 { gap: 1rem; }
      .text-center { text-align: center; }
      .cursor-pointer { cursor: pointer; }
      .space-y-4 > * + * { margin-top: 1rem; }
      .space-x-2 > * + * { margin-left: 0.5rem; }

      /* Spacing */
      .p-6 { padding: 1.5rem; }
      .px-3 { padding-left: 0.75rem; padding-right: 0.75rem; }
      .px-4 { padding-left: 1rem; padding-right: 1rem; }
      .px-6 { padding-left: 1.5rem; padding-right: 1.5rem; }
      .py-2 { padding-top: 0.5rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      .py-4 { padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; }
      .py-8 { padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; }
      .py-16 { padding-top: 4rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }
      .pt-6 { padding-top: 1.5rem; }
      .mb-2 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      .mb-4 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
      .mb-8 { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
      .mt-2 { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
      .mt-4 { margin-top: 1rem; }
      .mt-8 { margin-top: 2rem; }

      /* Type */
      .text-sm { font-size: 0.875rem; }
      .text-xl { font-size: 1.25rem; }
      .text-2xl { font-size: 1.5rem; }
      .text-3xl { font-size: 1.875rem; }
      .text-5xl { font-size: 3rem; }
      .text-6xl { font-size: 3.75rem; }
      .font-medium { font-weight: 500; }
      .font-semibold { font-weight: 600; }
      .font-bold { font-weight: 700; }
      .leading-4 { line-height: 1rem; }

      /* Colour */
      .bg-white { background-color: #fff; }
      .bg-blue-50 { background-color: #eff6ff; }
      .bg-green-50 { background-color: #f0fdf4; }
      .bg-yellow-50 { background-color: #fefce8; }
      .bg-green-500 { background-color: #22c55e; }
      .bg-green-600 { background-color: #16a34a; }
      .text-white { color: #fff; }
      .text-blue-600 { color: #2563eb; }
      .text-green-700 { color: #15803d; }
      .text-gray-400 { color: #9ca3af; }
      .text-gray-500 { color: #6b7280; }
      .text-gray-600 { color: #4b5563; }
      .text-gray-700 { color: #374151; }
      .text-gray-800 { color: #1f2937; }
      .text-gray-900 { color: #111827; }

      /* Borders */
      .border { border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: #e5e7eb; }
      .border-2 { border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; }
      .border-4 { border-width: 4px; border-style: solid; }
      .border-t { border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-color: #e5e7eb; }
      .border-transparent { border-color: transparent; }
      .border-blue-200 { border-color: #bfdbfe; }
      .border-green-300 { border-color: #86efac; }
      .border-yellow-300 { border-color: #fde047; }
      .border-gray-200 { border-color: #e5e7eb; }
      .border-gray-300 { border-color: #d1d5db; }
      .border-gray-400 { border-color: #9ca3af; }
      .rounded-md { border-radius: 0.375rem; }
      .rounded-lg { border-radius: 0.5rem; }
      .rounded-xl { border-radius: 0.75rem; }
      .rounded-full { border-radius: 9999px; }
      .shadow-sm { box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05); }
      .shadow-lg { box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1); }

      /* Sizes */
      .h-3 { height: 0.75rem; }
      .w-3 { width: 0.75rem; }

      /* Interaction. Buttons on this page are pressed by someone who may be
         holding a handset, so the focus ring is deliberately wide. */
      .hover\:bg-gray-50:hover { background-color: #f9fafb; }
      .hover\:bg-gray-100:hover { background-color: #f3f4f6; }
      .hover\:bg-green-700:hover { background-color: #15803d; }
      .hover\:text-gray-700:hover { color: #374151; }
      .focus\:ring-4:focus, .focus\:ring-green-300:focus, .focus\:ring-gray-300:focus {
        outline: 4px solid #86efac;
        outline-offset: 2px;
      }
      .focus\:ring-gray-300:focus { outline-color: #d1d5db; }

      /* Wider screens, matching the sm: and lg: prefixes in the markup. */
      @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .sm\:px-6 { padding-left: 1.5rem; padding-right: 1.5rem; }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .lg\:px-8 { padding-left: 2rem; padding-right: 2rem; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <%# No navigation. In link mode there is no account to navigate to, and a
        signed-in care receiver reaches the rest of the app from the dashboard.
        The one way back is offered only to somebody who can actually use it. %>
    <% unless link_mode? %>
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-6">
        <%= link_to "← Back to Remindly", dashboard_path, class: "text-gray-500 text-sm" %>
      </div>
    <% end %>

    <%# The script tag lives in the view, cache-busted, and stays there. %>
    <%= yield %>
  </body>
</html>
